        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CST2RDDSBRRR, Elegant Castle Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFeaturing a beautiful reed design topped with ornate urn tips and finished with exquisite matching rosettes, this Castle Collection door pull is as fancy as it is durable. The front door pull handle has a 1 inch diameter and is made of high quality brass, so you can be sure that it can withstand use on even heavy doors. This Elegant Split Reed Style Door Pull is normally used on entry doors but it also works great on any door where a traditionally styled, large pull is desired such as a shower pull or a <a href=\"/products/elegant-split-reed-appliance-pull-first-impressions-ap-cst2rddsbr\">refrigerator handle</a>. The Castle 2 Handle is available with thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting. Choose from a wide array of finishes in 20 inch, 24 inch, or 30 inch lengths. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CST02-specifications.gif?v=1704354534\" width=\"577\" height=\"230\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions CST2RDDSBRRR Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/elegant-split-reed-appliance-pull-first-impressions-ap-cst2rddsbr\"><b>Split Reed Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions CST2RDDSBRRR Door Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align =\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>The First Impressions Castle 2 Door Pull comes standard with the  <a href=\"/products/2-3-4-inch-decorative-reed-rosette-first-impressions-bst03002r\">2-3/4\" Diameter Round Reed Rosettes</a> for an extra level of decoration. The rosettes are removable if desired.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/833-1-detail-picture.jpg?v=1704354534\" target=\"new\"><b>FII-CST2 Detailed Picture</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CST02-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262222\"><b>First Impressions CST2RDDSBRRR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul> \r\n<b>CST2020RDDSBRRR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 13-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CST2024RDDSBRRR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 17-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CST2030RDDSBRRR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 23-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Elegant Split Reed Style Door Pull",
                "description": "The Elegant Split Reed Style Door Pull is available in 3 standard lengths of 20 inches, 24 inches, and 30 inches. Choose from an array of finish colors including Oil Rubbed Bronze, Satin Nickel and Antique Brass for this Castle 2 Handle.",
